to}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>:</b> <b>Wood</b> is common for use in <a href=\"/page/Quarterstaff\" title=\"Quarterstaff\">Quarterstaffs</a>, <a href=\"/page/Bow\" title=\"Bow\">bows</a>, or <a href=\"/page/Ammo\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ammo\">ammo</a>. It is light, but its durability is low.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Hardness:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Weight:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Base Value:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">10,000 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Location:\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic version</a> of <a href=\"/page/Item:Winter%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Item:Winter&#39;s Wrath\">Winter's Wrath</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere\" title=\"Otiluke&#39;s Freezing Sphere\">Otiluke's Freezing Sphere</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Otiluke%27s_Freezing_Sphere\" title=\"Otiluke&#39;s Freezing Sphere\">Otiluke's Freezing Sphere</a></b><br /><b>Caster level:</b> 20<br /><b>Charges: </b>15 (15/day)</span></span> <b>—</b> 15 Charges&#32;(Recharged/Day:15)</li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +111</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Glaciation\" title=\"Glaciation\">Glaciation +111</a>:</b> Passive: +111 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Cold <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +16%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Ice Lore +16</a>:</b> Passive: Your Cold spells gain a +16% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Wand_Maximizing\" title=\"Wand Maximizing\">Wand Maximizing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wand_Maximizing\" title=\"Wand Maximizing\">Wand Maximizing</a>:</b> Spells cast from this wand are treated as though they were Maximized, dealing 100% more damage than they normally would. This damage increase does not stack with bonuses granted by enhancements.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Winter%27s_Wrath.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Winter%27s_Wrath.png/420px-Epic_Winter%27s_Wrath.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"621\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Winter%27s_Wrath.png 1.5x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Legendary_Winter%27s_Wrath\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legendary Winter&#39;s Wrath\">Legendary Winter's Wrath</a> \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\"><i>A thin rod of blackened wood containing charges of the Otiluke's Freezing Sphere spell. Eternal wands recharge over time if they are not actively being used.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background: #DDF;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background: #EEF;\">Recharges at a rate of 1 charge per 30 seconds\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817040840\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2463/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18215/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6008/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.029      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   50.029      1 -total\n 95.63%   47.843      1 Template:Eternal_wand\n 43.87%   21.947      5 Template:Popup\n 36.62%   18.323      1 Template:Mat\n 16.60%    8.305     32 Template:IO\n 13.44%    6.725      1 Template:Bind\n 11.17%    5.586      1 Template:Spelllore\n  9.35%    4.677      1 Template:SpellPower\n  7.77%    3.889      1 Template:BgColorVar\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:10991-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817040840 and revision id 630595. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
